    <string name="settings_applies_next">Changes apply the next time a script starts.</string>
    <string name="settings_step1">Install Termux from F-Droid or GitHub (termux/termux-app). The Google Play build is outdated.</string>
    <string name="settings_step2">Claude: install Node.js and Claude Code. Versions 2.1.113 and newer do not run in Termux; you need 2.1.112:</string>
    <string name="settings_step3">Run claude and sign in with your Claude account (open the link in a browser, paste the code back into Termux).</string>
    <string name="settings_step4">Gemini: install and sign in via \"Login with Google\":</string>
    <string name="settings_step5">Allow other apps to run commands in Termux:</string>
    <string name="settings_step6">Tap \"Allow running commands in Termux\" above, disable battery optimization for Termux, and tap \"Check\".</string>
